#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:3
#: a4a55c87d9eb4e68b61a89e50c8fee82
msgid "晶格角应变（Shear Angle Strain）"
msgstr "Shear Angle Strain"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:5
#: e4a4dc592ade4e39a18a612cbae751b4
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr "**Category:** Lattice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:7
#: 8bed951335a6487da1d9414979f1fbf4
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:9
#: 6225e7f380c74dfdaf5eacdf1079e264
msgid "保持三条晶格矢量的长度不变，扫描晶格角的增量。适合单独补充角度形变数据，或检查模型对低对称晶胞的外推误差。"
msgstr ""
"Scan increments of the lattice angles while keeping all three lattice-vector lengths "
"fixed. Use this card to add angle-deformation data independently or to examine model "
"extrapolation for low-symmetry cells."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:11
#: 754225870a474647888c18fb8915ff7d
msgid "三个角的定义是："
msgstr "The three angles are defined as:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:13
#: 094899844b9e4a1d874a313edecefe4b
msgid "$\\alpha=\\angle(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:14
#: 31a2cef1f68c4e69982a54d106fc45b9
msgid "$\\beta=\\angle(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf c)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:15
#: 498c2ca8480440b8ad30941612548501
msgid "$\\gamma=\\angle(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:17
#: 9f5cfe88957d43e0b1ffedc8c3bcee5f
msgid "输入框填写的是相对原始角度的**增量**，不是最终角度，单位均为度。"
msgstr ""
"The fields specify **increments** relative to the original angles, not final angles. "
"All values are in degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:19
#: 1c78f0221b854314847fe205328c9a77
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:21
#: 8203b9cfa3124bb69456b46bfe709a4b
msgid "对每组增量 $(\\Delta\\alpha,\\Delta\\beta,\\Delta\\gamma)$："
msgstr "For each increment tuple $(\\Delta\\alpha,\\Delta\\beta,\\Delta\\gamma)$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:23
#: 8203b9cfa3124bb69456b46bfe709a4b
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\alpha'=\\alpha+\\Delta\\alpha,\\qquad\n"
"\\beta'=\\beta+\\Delta\\beta,\\qquad\n"
"\\gamma'=\\gamma+\\Delta\\gamma.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:29
#: 028b08bd2deb4ff592361159e840c985
msgid ""
"程序用 $(a,b,c,\\alpha',\\beta',\\gamma')$ 重建晶胞，其中 $a,b,c$ "
"保持原值。原子分数坐标随晶胞保持不变，因此笛卡尔位置会随形变移动。"
msgstr ""
"The program reconstructs the cell from $(a,b,c,\\alpha',\\beta',\\gamma')$, keeping "
"$a,b,c$ at their original values. Atomic fractional coordinates remain fixed relative"
" to the cell, so Cartesian positions move with the deformation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:31
#: d3968200fb9b44b888bc2041775ab1dc
msgid ""
"重建过程保留输入晶胞的全局取向，不额外施加刚体旋转。因此项目使用的 `spin:R:3` 和 ASE 的 `initial_magmoms` "
"均保留原笛卡尔分量。若输入同时含有这两类磁矩数据，两者都不会被角度应变改写。"
msgstr ""
"Reconstruction preserves the global orientation of the input cell and adds no rigid "
"rotation. Therefore, both the project's `spin:R:3` data and ASE `initial_magmoms` "
"retain their original Cartesian components. If the input contains both forms, neither"
" is modified by the angle strain."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:33
#: af33aaed89de45329ecc49a197eccd4c
msgid "每个角范围按 `[min, max, step]` 取点。若三条范围分别产生 $N_\\alpha$、$N_\\beta$、$N_\\gamma$ 个值，则："
msgstr ""
"Each angle range is sampled as `[min, max, step]`. If the three ranges produce "
"$N_\\alpha$, $N_\\beta$, and $N_\\gamma$ values, respectively:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:35
#: 8f2e9198173c49949b17e274acdf6668
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{in}}N_\\alpha N_\\beta N_\\gamma.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:39
#: c33771e0df1f4f54b9fe410e36eb2ec2
msgid ""
"默认每条范围为 `[-2, 2, 2]`，对应小角度弹性响应中的负向、参考和正向三点， 即每个输入生成 $3^3=27$ "
"个结构。界面会直接显示每个输入和全部输入的预计输出数。"
msgstr ""
"Each range defaults to `[-2, 2, 2]`, representing negative, reference, and positive "
"points for a small-angle elastic response. Each input therefore produces $3^3=27$ "
"structures. The interface shows estimated counts per input and across all inputs."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:42
#: 62867fbbdf584c9fbd44dfa191b39616
msgid "最终三个角必须都位于 $(0^\\circ,180^\\circ)$，并能组成非奇异、右手晶胞；不满足时会提示减小角度增量。"
msgstr ""
"All three final angles must lie within $(0^\\circ,180^\\circ)$ and form a "
"nonsingular, right-handed cell. Otherwise, the program asks you to reduce the angle "
"increments."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:44
#: cef5bc04fcfd4d84aac9b0a40141a75a
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:46
#: 0c1f951d6a47420c9cdb37ee024c3ac4
msgid "只扫描 $\\beta$ 角的 $-4^\\circ$ 到 $4^\\circ$，步长 $2^\\circ$："
msgstr "To scan only $\\beta$ from $-4^\\circ$ to $4^\\circ$ in steps of $2^\\circ$:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:48
#: e5187530687f4cb1909cc5c59b519f22
msgid ""
"Alpha increment: 0, 0, 1\n"
"Beta increment: -4, 4, 2\n"
"Gamma increment: 0, 0, 1\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:54
#: 5f7071bd2364440098357d7cfd66309f
msgid ""
"每个输入得到 5 个结构，对应 $\\Delta\\beta=-4,-2,0,2,4^\\circ$。三条晶格矢量长度不变；$\\alpha$ 和 $\\gamma$ "
"不变。"
msgstr ""
"Each input produces five structures corresponding to "
"$\\Delta\\beta=-4,-2,0,2,4^\\circ$. All lattice-vector lengths remain fixed, as do "
"$\\alpha$ and $\\gamma$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:56
#: 4fedf5566a3545949c1ab6b02b5cd075
msgid "不扫描某一通道时应填写 `[0, 0, 1]`。步长仍需为正数。"
msgstr "Enter `[0, 0, 1]` for an angle that is not scanned. Its step must still be positive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:58
#: 438a10c28cad41e1825f3263efa3b336
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:60
#: 0158d2c4508f4e81857443a494a31a0c
msgid "α 增量（alpha_range）"
msgstr "α Increment (alpha_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:62
#: c5e9723e945147d2aeec61184c18cb4d
msgid "默认 `[-2, 2, 2]`。$\\alpha=\\angle(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c)$ 的增量范围，单位为度。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[-2, 2, 2]`. Increment range for $\\alpha=\\angle(\\mathbf b,\\mathbf c)$, "
"in degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:64
#: dd2d0e632c634e339ca8e0464d92fcaa
msgid "β 增量（beta_range）"
msgstr "β Increment (beta_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:66
#: 7d36078a5cbf469b8481e68aaf51c3cb
msgid "默认 `[-2, 2, 2]`。$\\beta=\\angle(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf c)$ 的增量范围，单位为度。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[-2, 2, 2]`. Increment range for $\\beta=\\angle(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf c)$, in"
" degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:68
#: 7edb99b82009426d8109a46570a5c752
msgid "γ 增量（gamma_range）"
msgstr "γ Increment (gamma_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:70
#: a1fe4a766f3749699fda3067c9570499
msgid "默认 `[-2, 2, 2]`。$\\gamma=\\angle(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)$ 的增量范围，单位为度。"
msgstr ""
"Default `[-2, 2, 2]`. Increment range for $\\gamma=\\angle(\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)$, "
"in degrees."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:72
#: fa01144724ad4c2fb80e60f573045830
msgid "保持识别出的分子刚性（identify_organic）"
msgstr "Preserve Detected Molecular Rigidity (identify_organic)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:74
#: b826d7e2a6974fa28734ec02f4a48fb9
msgid "默认关闭。开启后，程序在晶胞仿射形变后恢复检测到的分子团内部几何，避免分子内键随晶胞一起拉伸。纯无机体系通常无需开启。"
msgstr ""
"Disabled by default. When enabled, the program restores the internal geometry of "
"detected molecular groups after the affine cell deformation, preventing "
"intramolecular bonds from stretching with the cell. It is normally unnecessary for "
"purely inorganic systems."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:76
#: cef5bc04fcfd4d84aac9b0a40141a75a
msgid "配置示例"
msgstr "Configuration Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:78
#: 9eabee7be8804373b3e595ef2d17a8ac
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"ShearAngleCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"params\": {\n"
"    \"alpha_range\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"beta_range\": [-4, 4, 2],\n"
"    \"gamma_range\": [0, 0, 1],\n"
"    \"identify_organic\": false\n"
"  }\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:91
#: e431710c74f34e9ab1584b5999932f89
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:93
#: 7eb6e424f147495ab658a50eecf1f945
msgid "**为什么角度改变后体积也变了？** 体积同时取决于晶格长度和夹角。长度固定不代表体积固定，这是正常的几何结果。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the volume change when only angles are changed?** Volume depends on both "
"lattice-vector lengths and their angles. Fixed lengths do not imply fixed volume; "
"this is the expected geometry."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:95
#: d7433b683aab4344b5c7eb52143d64ae
msgid ""
"**为什么输出数很快变大？** 三个角采用笛卡尔积组合。默认是 $3\\times3\\times3=27$ "
"个结构/输入；增加点数前应先确认确实需要联合扫描，而不是单角有限差分。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does the output count grow so quickly?** The three angle ranges form a "
"Cartesian product, giving $3\\times3\\times3=27$ structures per input by default. "
"Before adding points, confirm that a joint scan is needed rather than a one-angle "
"finite difference."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:97
#: 7f1869fadc8e4cc987cc060b7952fb07
msgid "**为什么提示晶胞无效？** 某组最终角度无法组成非奇异右手晶胞。缩小增量范围，尤其要检查原始角度已经接近 $0^\\circ$ 或 $180^\\circ$ 的情况。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the cell reported as invalid?** A set of final angles cannot form a "
"nonsingular, right-handed cell. Reduce the increment range, especially when an "
"original angle is already close to $0^\\circ$ or $180^\\circ$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:99
#: fc49c80ad48f470dac6c671e525992f9
msgid "**磁矩会跟着晶胞转动吗？** 不会。这张卡只做角度应变并保留输入全局坐标系；`spin:R:3` 与 ASE `initial_magmoms` 的笛卡尔分量均保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"**Do magnetic moments rotate with the cell?** No. This card applies angle strain "
"while preserving the input global coordinate system. Cartesian components of both "
"`spin:R:3` and ASE `initial_magmoms` remain unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:101
#: a49e118fed034c5eb822942a3d2ca594
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:103
#: a7106eb9e7f3482fa462cc4bab3d4333
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`Ang(alpha={Δα},beta={Δβ},gamma={Δγ})`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/shear-angle-card.md:105
#: ef82c933b1b14ec19c9dd7d836640336
msgid "标签记录三个角的增量，单位为度。该操作无随机性，相同输入和参数会生成相同结果。"
msgstr ""
"The label records the three angle increments in degrees. The operation has no "
"randomness, so identical inputs and parameters produce identical results."

#~ msgid "`alpha_range` = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 alpha）"
#~ msgstr "`alpha_range` = `[0, 0, 1]` (one zero offset)"

#~ msgid "`gamma_range` = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 gamma）"
#~ msgstr "`gamma_range` = `[0, 0, 1]` (one zero offset)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "在保持晶格长度不变的前提下扰动 alpha/beta/gamma 角，采样角度剪切自由度。每个角度通道独立控制 "
#~ "min/max/step（单位：度），扫描的是相对原始角度的增量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Sample angular shear by changing alpha, beta,"
#~ " and gamma while preserving lattice-vector "
#~ "lengths. Each channel has an independent "
#~ "minimum, maximum, and step in degrees, "
#~ "interpreted as offsets from the input angle."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\\alpha'=\\alpha+\\Delta\\alpha,\\quad \\beta'=\\beta+\\Delta\\beta,\\quad"
#~ " \\gamma'=\\gamma+\\Delta\\gamma"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "\\mathbf{C}'=\\mathrm{cellpar\\_to\\_cell}(a,b,c,\\alpha',\\beta',\\gamma')"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid "$a,b,c$ 保持原长度，三个 $\\Delta$ 值单位均为度。程序从新的六个晶格参数重建晶胞， 不是直接给某个矩阵元素加角度数值；原子分数坐标保持不变。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "$a,b,c$ keep their original lengths, and the"
#~ " three $\\Delta$ values are in degrees. The"
#~ " program rebuilds the cell from the six "
#~ "new lattice parameters rather than adding "
#~ "angle values directly to matrix elements; "
#~ "atomic fractional coordinates remain unchanged."

#~ msgid "场景：模型在单斜晶系上预测崩了，但正交晶系没问题"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: The model fails on a monoclinic phase but not an orthogonal one"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "你在 HfO2 上训练了一个 NEP "
#~ "模型。训练集里只有一个高温四方相（正交晶格），模型对四方相的能量和力预测很好。但一跑常温单斜相，能量误差跳了 3 倍——因为单斜相的 "
#~ "beta 角偏离 90 度约 10 度，模型没见过非正交的晶胞角度。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A HfO2 NEP trained only on a high-"
#~ "temperature tetragonal phase performs well there "
#~ "but triples its error on the monoclinic "
#~ "phase, whose beta angle differs from 90 "
#~ "degrees. Nonorthogonal cell geometry is out of"
#~ " domain."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 不同晶系的本质区别是晶胞角度。模型只在正交晶格上训练，隐式地学会了\"角度总是 90 度\"的先验。只要"
#~ " beta 偏离 90 "
#~ "度，晶格矢量在笛卡尔空间的投影关系就变了，原子间距分布也跟着变——模型全靠外推。解决办法是沿角度方向生成一组结构，让模型见过非 90 "
#~ "度的晶胞。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** Cell angles change the Cartesian "
#~ "projection of lattice vectors and therefore "
#~ "interatomic-distance distributions. Add controlled "
#~ "nonorthogonal cells so target angles are "
#~ "interpolated rather than extrapolated."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的 HfO2 四方相结构（alpha=beta=gamma=90°）"
#~ msgstr "alpha=beta=gamma=90°"

#~ msgid "**目标：** 沿 beta 方向生成 -6° 到 +6° 的角度扫描，步长 2°，覆盖单斜相可能出现的 beta 偏离"
#~ msgstr "**Objective:** Scan beta offsets from -6 to +6 degrees in 2-degree steps."

#~ msgid "**参数设置：**"
#~ msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#~ msgid "`α 角范围`（`alpha_range`） = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 alpha）"
#~ msgstr "`α angle range` (`alpha_range`) = `[0, 0, 1]` (do not scan alpha)"

#~ msgid "`β 角范围`（`beta_range`） = `[-6, 6, 2]`"
#~ msgstr "`β angle range` (`beta_range`) = `[-6, 6, 2]`"

#~ msgid "`γ 角范围`（`gamma_range`） = `[0, 0, 1]` （不扫 gamma）"
#~ msgstr "`γ angle range` (`gamma_range`) = `[0, 0, 1]` (do not scan gamma)"

#~ msgid "**输出：** 7 个结构（-6°, -4°, -2°, 0°, +2°, +4°, +6°），晶格长度不变，只有 beta 角偏离 90 度"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Seven structures with beta offsets "
#~ "-6, -4, -2, 0, +2, +4, and +6 "
#~ "degrees and unchanged lattice lengths."

#~ msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
#~ msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#~ msgid "重训后用单斜相参考数据做推理，能量误差应显著下降"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "After labeling and retraining, error on "
#~ "held-out monoclinic references should decrease."

#~ msgid "检查输出结构的体积：角度变化会轻微改变体积（晶格长度不变但矢量投影关系变了），确认体积变化 < 2%"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Check output volumes. Angles change vector "
#~ "projections even at fixed lengths, so define"
#~ " and verify an acceptable volume change for"
#~ " the study."

#~ msgid "如果模型对更多角度方向仍不准，同时放开 alpha 和 gamma 做多角度联合扫描"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If other angular directions remain inaccurate, "
#~ "add alpha and gamma scans deliberately."

#~ msgid "如果角度扫描范围 > ±10° 后结构明显非物理，可能是该体系不支持如此大的角度偏离"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If offsets beyond ±10 degrees produce "
#~ "implausible geometry, narrow the range to the"
#~ " material's intended phase space."

#~ msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
#~ msgstr "When to add this card"

#~ msgid "**加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#~ msgid "训练集仅覆盖高对称晶系（立方、四方），但目标体系存在低对称相（单斜、三斜）"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Training covers only high-symmetry cells while"
#~ " target phases are monoclinic or triclinic"

#~ msgid "模型在角度相关性质（如压电系数、角度依赖的弹性常数）上偏差大"
#~ msgstr "Angle-dependent properties such as piezoelectric or elastic response are inaccurate"

#~ msgid "需要区分\"角度变化\"和\"长度变化\"对模型的影响"
#~ msgstr "Angle and length effects need to be isolated"

#~ msgid "**不加：**"
#~ msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#~ msgid "体系始终维持高对称、角度不可能偏离 90 度 —— 加了产生无物理意义结构"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The intended system remains high symmetry and"
#~ " angular deviations are not physically relevant"

#~ msgid "需要同时控制长度和角度 → 用 `Lattice Perturb` 同时扰动两者更方便"
